# SQLite sidecars: `*.db` does not match these, and a WAL without its database
# is unreplayable. `transactions.db` itself is deliberately untracked.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# Vendored Windows Redis build: go.ps1 falls back to Redis/redis-server.exe,
# and redis-cli.exe is the client used by the runbooks. Debug symbols and the
# source archive are not needed in git.
Redis/*.pdb
Redis/Redis.zip
Redis/redis-benchmark.exe
Redis/redis-check-aof.exe

